# Games and Education for an NIEO.

**Authors:** Oxenham, John

## Abstract
Describes the &quot;Trading Game,&quot; a learning activity for high school students intended to help players understand how trade can affect the prosperity of a country. The game involves raw materials, technology, trading, bargaining power, and the creation and distribution of wealth. (RH)

